  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Performance and compatibility release: a tokenized read path and a record writer for generated code (recompile for the speed-up; libraries built against 4.8 or 4.9 keep working), a net11.0 asset, asynchronous stream reads and writes, and NewLineForWrite defaults to Environment.NewLine as in FileHelpers 3.x (a behaviour change on Linux and macOS). Changes: https://github.com/ModernLibs/FileHelpers/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md - Migrating from FileHelpers 3.x: https://github.com/ModernLibs/FileHelpers/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION.md",
